# Nothing is asked for on deploy.
#
# Set by the Blueprint: PORT, APP_URL, DB_CONNECTION_STRING, FILE_BACKEND,
# ENCRYPTION_KEY (generated), TRUST_PROXY,
# ANALYTICS_DISABLED.
#
# Optional, add on the pocket-id service after deploy:
# MAXMIND_LICENSE_KEY=           # IP geolocation in audit logs
# AUDIT_LOG_RETENTION_DAYS=90
# SMTP is configured in the admin UI, not with env vars.
# Full list: https://pocket-id.org/docs/configuration/environment-variables
